OL,3,GNEWSAPermission sought to sell rectory
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FRatepayers in Guernsey are being asked
OL,7,Ffor permission to sell a rectory that
OL,8,Fis currently "not fit to house"
OL,9,Ftenants.
OL,11,FSt Martins Constables want to sell St
OL,12,FMartins Rectory, which they said needed
OL,13,F"substantial investment" of about
OL,14,F#150,000 to improve and maintain.
OL,16,FA requirement for ratepayers on the
OL,17,Fisland to pay for rectories was
OL,18,Fscrapped in April 2025, but that change
OL,19,Fis not due to come into force until
OL,20,FJanuary 2030.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
